flowchart LR
    RQ1[RQ1: Technical reliability] --> OF[OrderFlow]
    OF --> F[Controlled faults]
    F --> M[Manual recovery]
    F --> A[Automated recovery]
    M --> TE[Technical evidence]
    A --> TE
    TE --> TR[Recovery / impact / intervention]

    RQ2[RQ2: Engineering practice] --> HT[Structured incident tasks]
    HT --> HM[H-M manual decision]
    HT --> HA[H-A automation assisted]
    HM --> HE[Human evidence]
    HA --> HE
    HE --> HR[Diagnosis / recovery / escalation]

    TR --> I[Socio-technical interpretation]
    HR --> I
